{"kind":"stack","id":"s-sound","title":"How sound travels: vibrations and the ear","theme":{"background":"#f5f7fa","foreground":"#1d2b3a","font":"Arial, sans-serif"}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c1","kind":"flash","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c1-t","content":"Vibration"},{"type":"text","id":"c1-e","content":"A quick back-and-forth movement. Vibrations make sound."},{"type":"button","id":"c1-b","label":"Next Card","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c2"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c2","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c2-q","content":"What makes a sound?"},{"type":"button","id":"c2-a","label":"Vibrations","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c3"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c2-b","label":"Colours","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c3"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c2-c","label":"Smells","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c3"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c3","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c3-q","content":"Sound needs something to travel through. What is this called?"},{"type":"button","id":"c3-a","label":"A medium","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c3-b","label":"A shadow","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c3-c","label":"A magnet","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c4","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c4-q","content":"Which medium can sound travel through?"},{"type":"button","id":"c4-a","label":"Air","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c4-b","label":"Glass","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c4-c","label":"Water","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c5","kind":"flash","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c5-t","content":"Eardrum"},{"type":"text","id":"c5-e","content":"A thin skin inside the ear that shakes when vibrations reach it."},{"type":"button","id":"c5-b","label":"Next Card","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c6"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c6","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c6-q","content":"Where do vibrations from sound go first in the ear?"},{"type":"button","id":"c6-a","label":"The eardrum","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c7"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c6-b","label":"The nose","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c7"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c6-c","label":"The tongue","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c7"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c7","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c7-q","content":"You are on a school trip by a river. A loud splash happens behind you. What do you do?"},{"type":"button","id":"c7-a","label":"Turn round to look","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c8"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c7-b","label":"Listen carefully first","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c9"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c8","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c8-t","content":"You turn round quickly and see a fish jump out of the water. Sound waves from the splash reached your ears through the air."},{"type":"button","id":"c8-b","label":"Continue","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c10"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c9","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c9-t","content":"You listen and hear the splash clearly. The vibrations travelled through the air to your eardrums."},{"type":"button","id":"c9-b","label":"Continue","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c10"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c10","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c10-q","content":"What happens to the eardrum when sound vibrations reach it?"},{"type":"button","id":"c10-a","label":"It shakes","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c11"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c10-b","label":"It turns to ice","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c11"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c10-c","label":"It changes colour","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c11"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c11","kind":"end","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c11-t","content":"You finished the sound and hearing lesson"},{"type":"text","id":"c11-m","content":"Well done. You now know how vibrations travel through a medium to your ear."}],"actions":[]}}
